if $ARGS[0] = 'intro_274':
	*clr & cla
	'<center><a><img <<$set_imgh>> src="<<$npc_img_path[''A274'']>>/274-1.jpg"></center>'
	'You walk over to a tall willowly blonde girl, "Hi I''m <<$pcs_nickname>>". The girl gives you a warm smile, "I''m <<$npc_firstname[''A274'']>> pleased to meet you. Where you from?" ''Pavlosk'' you reply, ''Yourself?'''
	'"I live Pushkin now but from Moscow originally.", <<$npc_firstname[''A274'']>> replles before another girl jumps in taking her attention.'
	act 'Leave': gt 'pushkin_ballet_evt','res_events', 'introductions'
end
if $ARGS[0] = 'intro_275':
	*clr & cla
	'<center><a><img height="600" src="<<$npc_img_path[''A275'']>>/275.jpg"></a></center>'
	'You notice girl writing in a small book she notices you looking at it, she makes an small attempt to try and avoid you. "Yes?", she asks, "I''m just introducing myself, <<$pcs_nickname>>". "Ah you''re the dancer from Pavlovsk looking critically at you." '
	'"Yes, how did you know?", you ask puzzled but before she ignores you and goes back to writing into the book.'
	act 'Leave': gt 'pushkin_ballet_evt','res_events', 'introductions'
end
if $ARGS[0] = 'intro_276':
	*clr & cla
	'<center><a><img height="600" src="<<$npc_img_path[''A276'']>>/276.jpg"></a></center>'
	'Glancing around the room you spot another girl and quickly approach her, "Hi I''m <<$pcs_nickname>>". The girl gives you a wary look, "Hello, I suppose I should introduce myself since it is obvious you don''t know me. I''m <<$npc_firstname[''A276'']>> . I am one of the best dancers in Russia.", she looks at you coldly as expecting you to know her and seeing your blank look looks disdainfully at you before walking off.'
	act 'Leave': gt 'pushkin_ballet_evt','res_events', 'introductions'
end
if $ARGS[0] = 'intro_277':
	*clr & cla
	'<center><a><img height="600" src="<<$npc_img_path[''A277'']>>/277.jpg"></a></center>'
	'As you turn from your last conversation you glance toward the entrance to the communal room and notice a young girl nervously watching girls having fun. '
	'As you approach you notice she starts to look at the door more frequently and you think she is about to bolt from the room. You hold up your hands to try and calm her and give what you hope is a warm smile.'
	'"I''m <<$pcs_nickname>>, what is wrong?", you ask concerned about her behaviour.'
	'"I am <<$npc_firstname[''A277'']>>.", her answer is short and abrupt in a quiet voice you barely hear over the noise in the room.'
	'"Are you looking forward to the classes this week?", you ask trying to engage her more.'
	'She frowns at you, her eyes betraying her nervousness. "Yes, I suppose I am. Thank you for your concern.", and as she says this she bolts from the room leaving you standing there dumbfounded. Then a few moments later you see Madam <<$npc_lastname[''A284'']>> quickly follow her out of the room.'
	'You briefly think about following them to see what is wrong with <<$npc_firstname[''A277'']>> but instead decide to give her privacy.'
	act 'Leave': gt 'pushkin_ballet_evt','res_events', 'introductions'
end
if $ARGS[0] = 'intro_278':
	*clr & cla
	'<center><a><img height="600" src="<<$npc_img_path[''A278'']>>/278.jpg"></a></center>'
	'A gap appears in the crows of girls and you spot a tall, stunningly beautiful girl at the drinks table and you make your way over to her.'
	'"Hi!", you call out as you approach her, "I''m <<$pcs_nickname>>"'
	'The girl gives you a warm smile as she gracefully turns, her eyes sparkle as she greets you in a warm and entrancing voice, "Hi I''m <<$pcs_nickname>>", I''m <<$npc_firstname[''A278'']>>. Such a pleasure to meet you.'
	'"Are you one of the students?", you ask noting she''s older than the rest of the students before biting back your words.'
	'"Don''t worry <<$pcs_nickname>>, I am used to that reaction.", she gives you a smile to reassure you, "I am a late bloomer as it where, and I''ve been studying as a Thespian performer and I have been invited to this class to expand my abilities."'
	'"You''re an actress? Wow, have you starred in any roles?", you ask her excitedly.'
	'"Several, mostly Shakespearian roles as that is my love.", she closes her eyes briefly lost in her memories, "I enjoy playing Titania in A Midsummer Night’s Dream"'
	'"Titania, Why?"'
	'"Because she is subject to a cruel joke, but throughout all the play she remains steadfast to her beliefs and has a deep inner strength much like my faith in God. She has many admirable qualities despite beng married to a fool and idiot."'
	'"I have been an actress since I was four and have performed in several shows, I was forced into ballet by my parents because they smelt money.", she frowns at that, "But here i am gossiping about myself what about you?"'
	'"I have been wanting to be a ballerina all my life, but it has been difficult. My school had evening classes that I have been taking and they gave me other opportunities to perform and train in the local community centre."'
	'"So this is a great opportunity for you <<$pcs_nickname>>? I wish you all the best. Don''t fear of any competition from me I am more interested in pursuing my career as an actress than a ballerina. I want to become famous and go to Hollywood."'
	'"Then why are you here?" You ask confused."'
	'"My agent said it would be a great experience for an upcoming role about a ballerina. Oh, Madam <<$npc_lastname[''A284'']>> is staring at us. I think we need to be more sociable!", she takes your hand gracefully, "I know what it is like to struggle <<$pcs_nickname>>, and by the will of God, I really do wish you all the best and you achieve your dreams."'
	'"With this <<$npc_firstname[''A278'']>> leaves you at the table staring after her as she navigates her way through the crowd being socialable, you can''t help but wonder at how effortlessly she manages to captivate the people she speaks to.'
	act 'Leave': gt 'pushkin_ballet_evt','res_events', 'introductions'
end
