	'<center><a><img height="600" src="<<$npc_img_path[''A279'']>>/279.jpg"></a></center>'
	'You see a girl talking animatedly to Madam <<$npc_lastname[''A284'']>> as you approach them, Madam <<$npc_lastname[''A284'']>> looks at you sharply before she leaves the girl with a glare.'
	'"Hello, you must be <<$pcs_nickname>>", she says with a cheeky grin."'
	'"Yes, how did you know?"'
	'"It''s not really a secret at the school that people are saying you''re the next upcoming prodigy of Pavlovsk and the first in ages to attend here. You''re quite the subject of the school gossip but I am being so remiss I''m <<$npc_firstname[''A279'']>>"'
	'"I''m being spoken about?", you reply surprised at being recognised, "I saw you talking to Madam <<$npc_lastname[''A284'']>>, hope you''re not in trouble?" '
	'"No, nothing of the sort.", she sighs, "Just one of those things", she says with a grimace, "Howvever, I do wish you well and gain one of the sponsored positions this year. If you need help anytime talk to Madam <<$npc_lastname[''A284'']>>, and she will do what she can to help you."'
	'"Thank you, I will keeep that in mind. Madam <<$npc_lastname[''A284'']>> seems intimidating."'
	'"More than you realise <<$pcs_nickname>>", more than you realise.", She gives a small laugh, "however I can''t monopolise all your time tonight, we need to meet the other girls! She gives you friendly laugh and another cheeky grin as she twirls into the crowd leaving you in bewilderment staring after her.'
	act 'Leave': gt 'pushkin_ballet_evt','res_events', 'introductions'
end
